# GitHub Linguist Language Detection Configuration
# Mark third-party web runtime binaries and bundles as vendored
public/*.mjs linguist-vendored
public/*.js linguist-vendored
public/*.wasm linguist-vendored
dist/** linguist-vendored
node_modules/** linguist-vendored

# Ensure Python codebase is properly tracked as primary language
*.py linguist-detectable=true
visionsense/** linguist-detectable=true
